I'm considering how long the tool cleanup command takes—about 45 seconds at startup. I think I can afford to wait 1000 minutes and set a minimum poll at 5 seconds since the code was initially tested for immediate execution. There's no point in wasting tokens, so it might be better to extend the wait time further to 10000. Making sure everything runs smoothly seems important!
